(iii) Data elements used to query the automated license plate reader system;
(iv) Specific purpose for accessing or querying the automated license plate reader system, including the offense type for any criminal investigation;
(v) The associated call for service or case number; and
(vi) The location of the cameras that are part of the automated license plate reader system accessed.
